Source: historic-routing
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Chenlang Li <Cc1580155hsg@163.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               build-essential, autoconf, automake, libtool, bison, flex,
               pkg-config, gcc, g++, make, git, tar, gzip, xz-utils, patch,
               python3, python3-dev, python3-pytest,
               libjson-c-dev, libyang-dev (>= 3), libcap-dev, libreadline-dev,
               libpcre2-dev, libc-ares-dev, libelf-dev, libsystemd-dev,
               patchelf, file
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/lichenlang89/historic-routing
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/lichenlang89/historic-routing.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/lichenlang89/historic-routing

Package: historic-routing-runtime
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: historic-routing-abi (= @ABI@)
Description: FRRouting-based framework for historic routing protocols
 (development build, NOT released)
 .
 historic-routing 是一个独立项目：以 FRRouting 为底层框架，
 复活已经退出主流使用的历史路由协议（EGP、GGP、HELLO…）。
 本项目不是 FRRouting 官方项目。
 .
 This package ships the shared framework of one specific build:
 the runtime library (libfrr.so.0), zebra, vtysh and the configuration
 skeleton. Everything is installed under @PREFIX@ and does not touch the
 distribution FRR (/usr/sbin/frr*, /etc/frr, /usr/lib/*/frr, frr.service).
 .
 NOTE: this is a development build ("@VERSION@", source commit @COMMIT@);
 it is not a released version. Its zebra and the distribution frr.service
 both program the kernel RIB, so they must not run at the same time.

Package: historic-routing-egp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         historic-routing-runtime (= ${binary:Version}),
         historic-routing-abi (= @ABI@)
Description: experimental EGP (RFC 904) daemon for historic-routing
 (development build, NOT released)
 .
 historic-routing 的 EGP（RFC 904）守护进程 egpd。这是实验性的
 stub gateway 实现，不是 RFC 904 意义上的 core gateway，
 也不建议用于生产网络。
 .
 This package is bound to one exact build of the runtime:
 it requires both the same version-release of historic-routing-runtime and
 the same historic-routing-abi marker (@ABI@ = source commit + FRR base
 commit), because the ZAPI enums, the EGP route-type number and the vtysh
 bit are compile-time constants shared with libfrr and zebra.
 .
 NOTE: development build ("@VERSION@", source commit @COMMIT@),
 not a release.
